  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mwandama Soya Capacity Building Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mwandama Cooperative Union is a registered farmer cooperative that is composed of 8 primary cooperatives. The farmers in the Union grow different crops including soya beans, groundnuts, pigeon peas, horticulture crops and maize among others. The Union is seeking for a financial push to improve their management capacity, increase the farmers&apos; access to quality inputs, increase the Union&apos;s capital and improve the farmer skills in soya production.</narrative>
  </description>
